msgid "Leave Blank for Auto Detection which runs must faster."
msgstr "Shiya Kungenanto ukuze kuBhaqwe ngokuZenzekelayo okusebenza ngokukhawuleza kakhulu."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Cacti Table Detection"
msgstr "Ukubhaqwa kweeTheyibhile ze-Cacti"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How to tell Cacti-native tables apart from other tables referenced in the slow query log. Defaults to detecting every table with no grouping."
msgstr "Indlela yokwahlula iitheyibhile ze-Cacti kwezinye iitheyibhile ekubhekiswa kuzo kwilogi yemibuzo ecothayo. Okungagqibekanga kukubhaqa itheyibhile nganye ngaphandle kokuhlanganisa."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables (no 'OTHER TABLES' grouping)"
msgstr "Bhaqa zonke iitheyibhile (akukho kuhlanganisa kwe-'OTHER TABLES')"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Use this Cacti Database; group other tables as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Sebenzisa le Dathabheyisi ye-Cacti; hlanganisa ezinye iitheyibhile njenge-'OTHER TABLES'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables; group tables not in the list below as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Bhaqa zonke iitheyibhile; hlanganisa iitheyibhile ezingekho kuluhlu olungezantsi njenge-'OTHER TABLES'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Tables of Interest"
msgstr "Iitheyibhile Ezibalulekileyo"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only used by the 'Detect all tables; group ... as OTHER TABLES' option above. Please provide a space delimited list of known tables to compare against. In Linux/UNIX, you may obtain a list of tables by using the following command:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>The values of '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', and '<i><b>database</b></i>' are replaced with your values."
msgstr "Isetyenziswa kuphela lukhetho oluthi 'Bhaqa zonke iitheyibhile; hlanganisa ... njenge-OTHER TABLES' olungentla. Nceda unike uluhlu olwahlulwe ngezithuba lweetheyibhile ezaziwayo ukuze kuthelekiswe nazo. Kwi-Linux/UNIX, ungafumana uluhlu lweetheyibhile ngokusebenzisa lo myalelo ulandelayo:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>Amaxabiso ka-'<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', kunye no-'<i><b>database</b></i>' atshintshwa ngamaxabiso akho."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Upload Limits"
msgstr "Imida Yokulayisha"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "File Size upload limits in Cacti."
msgstr "Imida yobungakanani befayile yokulayisha kwi-Cacti."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Upload Filesize"
msgstr "Ubungakanani Obukhulu Befayile Yokulayisha"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum filesize your Apache server will allow to be uploaded is set to the value on the right.  Currently, you can not upload a file larger than this.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> and increase the value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Ubungakanani befayile obukhulu iseva yakho ye-Apache eya kuvumela ukuba bulayishwe bumiselwe kwixabiso elisekunene. Okwangoku, awukwazi ukulayisha ifayile enkulu kunale. Ukuba uneelogi ezicothayo ze-MySQL ezinkulu kunale, kufuneka uguqule ifayile ye-<i>php.ini</i> ehambelana ne-Apache, ufumane ixabiso elithi <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> kwaye unyuse ixabiso. Emva koko kufuneka uqale kwakhona i-Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Post Size"
msgstr "Ubungakanani Obukhulu be-Post"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum size you can post to the Apache server is set to the value on the right.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this value, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> and increase its value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Ubungakanani obukhulu onokubuthumela kwiseva ye-Apache bumiselwe kwixabiso elisekunene. Ukuba uneelogi ezicothayo ze-MySQL ezinkulu kuneli xabiso, kufuneka uguqule ifayile ye-<i>php.ini</i> ehambelana ne-Apache, ufumane ixabiso elithi <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> kwaye unyuse ixabiso layo. Emva koko kufuneka uqale kwakhona i-Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Ixesha Elikhulu Lokusebenza"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How long (in seconds) this request is allowed to run for; 0 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests, but a web server or reverse proxy in front of PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) can still cut the request off independently - that cannot be detected or overridden from here."
msgstr "Ixesha elide (ngemizuzwana) esi sicelo sivunyelwe ukuba sisebenze ngalo; u-0 uthetha okungenamda. Le plugin sele iwunyusela kwindawo engenamda kwizicelo zayo, kodwa iseva yewebhu okanye iproksi ejongene ne-PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) isenokusinqumla isicelo ngokuzimeleyo - oko akunakubhaqwa okanye kutshintshwe apha."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Okungenamda"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "Umda Wememori"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How much memory this request is allowed to use; -1 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests. A very large slow query log being read/imported in a single request can exceed a limited value."
msgstr "Ingakanani imemori esi sicelo sivunyelwe ukuyisebenzisa; u--1 uthetha okungenamda. Le plugin sele iwunyusela kwindawo engenamda kwizicelo zayo. Ilogi yemibuzo ecothayo enkulu kakhulu efundwayo/engeniswayo kwisicelo esinye ingagqitha kwixabiso elinomda."

